<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s249S">When they look at a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s249w3">single</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s249w2">thing</span>, a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s249w1">stream of water</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s249w4">each one</span> sees what the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s249w6">ripening</span> of his particular <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s249w5">karma</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s249w7">forces</span> him to see. A <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s249w8">craving spirit</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s249w14">sees</span> the river <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s249w13">full</span> of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s249w9"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s249m10">pus</span> and <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s249m11">blood</span></span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s249w12">and the like</span>.<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s249p16"><span class="nul">Agentive kyis marks the craving spirit as the perceiver. English realizes this through active subject position before sees, with no separate case word.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s249p15"><span class="nul">Concluding coordination to the next being has no separate English exponent within this row.</span></span></span>
